NT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 교무처 학사관리팀 방문 신청[본관 201호]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 신청서류 : 졸업유예신청서 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 등록기간 : 2012.07.19.(목)~07.20.(금), 농협</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷고지서 출력 : 원스톱서비스-등록금 고지내역 조회</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 등록금액 : 기성회비의 1/6 해당액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 유의사항</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;① 졸업유예 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 졸업유예 신청이 완료됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;② 등록금 인상에 따른 차액(인상분) 발생시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 추가로 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 졸업유예신청이 완료됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;③ 2012학년도 2학기 수강을 희망하는 자는 수강신청기간내에 수강신청을 하고, </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수업연한초과자 기준으로 등록금을 납부하되 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기납부금액에서 차액만 납부하면 됩니다.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;④ 재학연한범위내에서 가능하며, 최대 4회까지 신청가능합니다.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷1회 신청시 한학기만 신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><hr style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: black 0px; BORDER-TOP: black 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 0px; HEIGHT: 1px\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2012. 6. </span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> </strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
